<row rowsep="1">
<entry colname="1" morerows="0" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>The message "Please check the telephone" is displayed from the first connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="2" colsep="1" align="left">
<ptxt>It is highly likely that the cellular phone being used is not G-BOOK compatible, so have the customer check it (compatible models can be checked at G-BOOK.com on the Internet)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="3" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>-</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep="1">
<entry colname="1" morerows="0" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>"Please check the telephone" is displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="2" colsep="1" align="left">
<ptxt>Refer to troubleshooting flowchart [Communication Failure]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="3" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>
<xref href="RM0000036FZ010X" label="XX-XX"/>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep="1">
<entry colname="1" morerows="0" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>"Telephone is not connected" is displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="2" colsep="1" align="left">
<ptxt>Refer to troubleshooting flowchart [Communication Failure]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="3" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>
<xref href="RM0000036FZ010X" label="XX-XX"/>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep="1">
<entry colname="1" morerows="0" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>The message "Please wait" appears and it temporarily takes a long time until the screen is displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="2" colsep="1" align="left">
<ptxt>This is due to radio wave conditions or base station congestion and is not a malfunction (explain to the customer and have them continue using it)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="3" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>-</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep="1">
<entry colname="1" morerows="0" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>"Line is busy. Please wait a while before use" is displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="2" colsep="1" align="left">
<ptxt>The carrier is restricting outgoing calls from the telephone, so explain to the customer that they should wait a while before using it</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="3" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>-</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep="1">
<entry colname="1" morerows="0" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>The message "Cannot display because the line is busy, etc. Please wait a while before operating" is temporarily displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="2" colsep="1" align="left">
<ptxt>This is due to radio wave conditions or base station congestion and is not a malfunction (explain to the customer and have them continue using it)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="3" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>-</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep="1">
<entry colname="1" morerows="0" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>"Cannot display because the line is busy, etc. Please wait a while before operating" continues to be displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="2" colsep="1" align="left">
<ptxt>Refer to troubleshooting flowchart [Communication Failure]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="3" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>
<xref href="RM0000036FZ010X" label="XX-XX"/>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep="1">
