<ptxt>"Out of communication range. Please move into communication range before use" is displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="2" colsep="1" align="left">
<ptxt>Wait a while, change location and operate again (move into communication range)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="3" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>-</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep="1">
