<row rowsep="1">
<entry colname="1" morerows="2" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>"Communication is locked. Please release the lock before use" is displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="2" colsep="1" align="left">
<ptxt>Explain to the customer that the communication lock must be released to use G-BOOK</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="3" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>-</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep="1">
<entry colname="2" colsep="1" align="left">
<ptxt>If the customer has forgotten how to release the communication lock (PIN), check according to the owner's manual</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="3" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>-</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep="1">
<entry colname="2" colsep="1" align="left">
<ptxt>If the customer has also forgotten the reminder (answer to the question), or if the PIN and reminder are unknown, refer to [Communication Lock Release (Master PIN Code (4 Digits))]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="3" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>
<xref href="RM000001C3S022X" label="XX-XX"/>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep="1">
<entry colname="1" morerows="2" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>"Cannot be used because time data is old. Please receive GPS" is displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="2" colsep="1" align="left">
<ptxt>Refer to HDD Navigation System - Problem Symptoms Table [GPS mark is not displayed]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="3" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>
<xref href="RM0000008WW03VX" label="XX-XX"/>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep="1">
<entry colname="2" colsep="1" align="left">
<ptxt>If the GPS mark is displayed, wait a while, change location and operate again</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="3" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>-</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep="1">
<entry colname="2" colsep="1" align="left">
<ptxt>If the symptom recurs, replace the navigation receiver assembly</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="3" colsep="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>
<xref href="RM000001XG5006X" label="XX-XX"/>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
